# The repository root .gitignore has a generic `build/` rule for compiler
# output, which also matches this site's `build/` documentation section and
# silently drops hand-written pages from commits. Re-include the directory
# (git cannot re-include files whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# directory itself must be negated first); individual generated pages inside
# it are still ignored by the explicit entries below.
!src/content/docs/build/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated by scripts/prepare.mjs — do NOT edit, and do NOT commit.
# Each entry below is a rendered copy of a canonical file elsewhere in the
# repo. Edit the source, then re-run `npm run dev` (or `node scripts/prepare.mjs`).
# The authoritative mapping lives in scripts/sync_docs.mjs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

